{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 1, "text": "¡MILA! ¡NO! ¡ESTÁS LOCA!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 3, "text": "¡JA-JA-JA-JA-JA! ¡¡TE ENCONTRÉ, CARIÑITO!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 4, "text": "¡¿Qué veo?! ¡¿Una nueva expresión?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 5, "text": "Vamos... ¡¡MUÉSTRAME MÁS!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 6, "text": "¡¡Verte igual era TAAAAN ABURRIIIDOO!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 8, "text": "// Mita arena \"Hello\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 9, "text": "¿Cómo está mi pequeño nómada?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 10, "text": "¿No te cansas de tanto correr?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 12, "text": "¿Qué hiciste con Mila?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 14, "text": "Oh... ¡así que aún no te cansas!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 15, "text": "¡Perfecto! ¡vamos a jugar otro juego!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 17, "text": "Tú..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 19, "text": "¡Empecemos con una prueba!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 20, "text": "¡Probaremos tu coordinación!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 21, "text": "¡y tu habilidad para reaccionar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 22, "text": "¡¿Qué pasa si hay algo malo contigo!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 23, "text": "¿¡Qué pasa si ni siquiera mereces esa PIEL"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 24, "text": "que estás tan orgulloso de portar!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 25, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 26, "text": "// Show knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 27, "text": "Ahora mira..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 28, "text": "¿cuál prefieres?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 29, "text": "¿Derecha?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 30, "text": "o quizás..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 31, "text": "¿la izquierda?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 33, "text": "// Throw knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 34, "text": "Ay, ¿lo dices en serio?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 35, "text": "¿Siquiera importa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 36, "text": "¡Sólo estaba jugando contigo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 37, "text": "De todos modos, apuñalar es cosa del pasado."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 38, "text": "¡Como sea!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 39, "text": "Tengo... mejores juegos para ti."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 40, "text": "Como..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 41, "text": "// Show recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 42, "text": "¡mira esto!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 43, "text": "¡Necesitamos algo de música!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 44, "text": "¿Qué te parece la melodía?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 45, "text": "¡Me acelera el corazón!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 46, "text": "Ahora"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 47, "text": "te diré las reglas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 48, "text": "// Show rules"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 49, "text": "Mientras la canción esté sonando,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 50, "text": "¡puedes moverte!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 51, "text": "Pero, si la música para..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 52, "text": "¡NO TE MUEVAS!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 53, "text": "O te mataré."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 54, "text": "Es simple, llega al final antes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 55, "text": "de que la canción termine."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 56, "text": "¡Empecemos!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 57, "text": "¿Sigues parado ahí?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 58, "text": "¡Corre, querido, corre!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Ready recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 61, "text": "¡Ay!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 62, "text": "¡Mírate! ¡tan obediente!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 63, "text": "Un espécimen perfecto."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 64, "text": "¡Te quiero para mí solita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 65, "text": "Pero eso fue muy fácil, ¿no es así?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 67, "text": "¡Ya déjame ir!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 69, "text": "¡No te pongas tan cómodo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 70, "text": "¡Aún nos queda TANTO por jugar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 71, "text": "Aquí el siguiente juego:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 72, "text": "Voy a cerrar mis ojos..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 73, "text": "y cuando los abra,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 74, "text": "¡más te vale que no te vea!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 75, "text": "¿Lo entiendes?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 76, "text": "Si te veo, ¡voy a castigarte!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 77, "text": "¡Bien! ¡vamos a empezar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 79, "text": "Esto es inútil..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Ready hide"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 82, "text": "¡Lo lograste!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 83, "text": "¡Bien hecho, esto se pone interesante!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 84, "text": "Pero ahora será más difícil..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 85, "text": "MUCHO MÁS DIFÍCIL."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 86, "text": "¡¡Escóndete, corre, rueda!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 88, "text": "¡¡¡VETE AL INFIERNO!!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player falls"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 91, "text": "Agh... creo que logré escapar..."}
